@startuml

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

participant "TMF 915\nDeploymentScheduler" as Scheduler
participant "Vendor-Agnostic\nDeployment Adapter" as Adapter
participant "Pluggable Build Engine\n(e.g., MLflow, Kaniko, S2I)" as Builder
database "Artifact Store\n(MinIO / S3)" as Repo
participant "Docker Daemon\n(Host Node)" as Docker

activate Scheduler
Scheduler -> Adapter: Initiate Instantiation\n(model_name, hash: m-846ff...)
activate Adapter

== 1. Image Reusability (Caching) ==
Adapter -> Docker: Check if base Image "m-846ff..." exists
Docker --> Adapter: Return Image Status

alt Image NOT Found (Cache Miss)
    == 2. Blueprint Build Process ==
    Adapter -> Builder: Trigger Custom Image Build
    activate Builder
    
    note over Builder
        Agnostic interface allows plugging
        in any container build engine
    end note
    
    Builder -> Repo: Fetch Model Binaries & Configurations
    Repo --> Builder: Artifacts Downloaded
    Builder -> Builder: Resolve Software Dependencies\n(e.g., Python, Conda)
    Builder -> Docker: Package & Register new Image\n(tagged: m-846ff...)
    deactivate Builder
else Image Exists (Cache Hit)
    Adapter -> Adapter: Bypass intensive\ncompilation stage entirely
end

== 3. Container Identity Resolution ==
Adapter -> Adapter: Generate trackable container boundary\n(e.g., ai-model-name-846ff...)

== 4. Spin Up Endpoint ==
Adapter -> Docker: Run Container\n(Image: m-846ff..., ContainerName: generated-name)
Docker --> Adapter: Container Running\n(Prediction Ports mapped)

Adapter --> Scheduler: Return active deployment traits\n(hostPort, dockerHost, state: ACTIVE)
deactivate Adapter
deactivate Scheduler

@enduml